keywords:
  - social bot detection
  - multimodal learning
  - informative missingness
  - reliability-guided expert routing
  - BERTweet
  - TwiBot
abstract: >-
  Reproducible implementation of a leakage-controlled multimodal social bot
  detection pipeline with modality-specific experts, validation-guided routing,
  missingness-bias auditing, debiased learning, probability calibration,
  robustness stress tests, statistical inference, and independent TwiBot-20
  validation.

